OL,3,GNEWSAParents call for tougher measures
OL,4,Ain schools to tackle allergies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Stephanie Kerr's five-year-old son
OL,7,FCaolan many foods come with a serious
OL,8,Frisk.
OL,10,F"Caolan's allergic to milk, egg, wheat,
OL,11,Foat, cumin, tuna, strawberry," she
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,F"We have a running joke that it would
OL,15,Fbe quicker listing what he's not
OL,16,Fallergic to so that's just some of
OL,17,Fthem."
OL,19,FKerr is one of a number of parents
OL,20,Fcalling for new mandatory measures in
OL,21,Fschools to keep pupils like Caolan
OL,22,Fsafe.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
